# SSH Commands

## Connect to a Goms Terminal
    
    ssh roland@192.168.1.150

## Multihost Filsystem Session with Goms

Establish session: 

    sudo sshfs -o allow-other,default-permissions roland@192.68.1.150/home/roland /mnt/remote_goms


### Example copy directory/files FROM Goms to Binn 

    cp -rp remote_goms/<file-name>  <file-name>

### Disconnect session

    sudo umount /mnt/remote_goms



